# Robustness, asked separately and asked narrowly.
#
# Screening and RSM have already settled butter and time. What is left is the
# question those stages cannot answer: of the temperatures and doughs that all
# taste fine on a good oven, which one still tastes fine on a bad one?
#
# Few control factors on purpose. A crossed design multiplies runs by the outer
# array, and a noise effect has to compete with every control effect for the
# same nine rows -- so this is the wrong place to also be screening.
factors:
  temp: 350, 375, 400
  flour: 2.0, 2.375, 2.75

noise:
  oven: -30, 30

array: L9
